<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merix Corp cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merix Corp cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said it cut its rating on Merix Corp to underperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not available.</p>
<p>-- The stock was down one at 15.</p>
</text>
